SUMMARY:Arkansas: AR1050 due
DESCRIPTION:Arkansas partnership return due the 15th day of the 4th month a
 fter year-end (or the first business day after\, if that date falls on a we
 ekend/holiday). The one-month federal-extension-based extension is unusuall
 y short relative to most states' 5-6 month patterns - flagged for the Clien
 t's attention. | Arkansas partnership return due the 15th day of the 4th mo
 nth after year-end (or the first business day after\, if that date falls on
  a weekend/holiday). The one-month federal-extension-based extension is unu
 sually short relative to most states' 5-6 month patterns - flagged for the 
